      "content": "🏆 Final Evaluation Report:\n# 📋 GHOST HACKER - Production Readiness Report\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL STATUS: NO EPISODE DATA DETECTED\n\n```\n╔════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║  QA EVALUATION STATUS: INCOMPLETE      ║\n║  Reason: Awaiting Episode Generation   ║\n║  Current State: System Standby         ║\n╚════════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 EVALUATION SUMMARY\n\n### **Completion Score: 0%**\n**Status**: ❌ **CANNOT EVALUATE - NO EPISODE CONTENT PROVIDED**\n\nThe system is currently in **standby mode** awaiting scenario input. No actual episode content (scenes, dialogue, panels) has been generated for quality assurance review.\n\n---\n\n## 📊 ASSESSMENT BREAKDOWN\n\n### 1. **Completion Score**: `0/100`\n- ❌ No episode metadata present\n- ❌ No scene breakdown available\n- ❌ No dialogue to evaluate\n- ❌ No visual direction provided\n- ❌ No character interactions to assess\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Narrative Flow \u0026 Pacing**: `N/A`\n**Status**: Cannot assess without content\n\n**What I Need to Evaluate**:\n- Beat structure (Setup → Conflict → Escalation → Resolution)\n- Scene transitions (cuts, fades, time jumps)\n- Rhythm Unit (RU) distribution across panels\n- Emotional arc progression\n- Cliffhanger effectiveness (if episode ending)\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Character Integrity**: `N/A`\n**Status**: Cannot assess without dialogue\n\n**What I Need to Evaluate**:\n- **Reina \"Ren\" Shimizu**: Tech-speak authenticity, vulnerability vs. confidence balance\n- **Cipher**: Mysterious mentor tone, cryptic guidance style\n- **Vex**: Chaotic energy, unpredictability in speech patterns\n- **Supporting Cast**: Consistency with established personalities\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Visual Production Readiness**: `N/A`\n**Status**: Cannot assess without cinematic prompts\n\n**What I Need to Evaluate**:\n- Camera angle specifications (Dutch angle, POV, wide shot, etc.)\n- Lighting cues (neon glow, shadow contrast, screen illumination)\n- Environmental details (cyberpunk atmosphere, tech props)\n- Character expression notes\n- Panel composition (rule of thirds, leading lines)\n\n---\n\n### 5. **Technical Compliance (SHACL Principles)**: `N/A`\n**Status**: Cannot validate without structured data\n\n**What I Need to Check**:\n- **RU Count**: 8-12 per scene (optimal pacing)\n- **Dialogue Ratio**: 40-60% (balance with visual storytelling)\n- **Scene Length**: 3-5 minutes average\n- **Character Distribution**: Balanced screen time\n- **Thematic Consistency**: Alignment with Ghost Hacker core themes\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 REQUIRED NEXT STEPS\n\nTo proceed with quality assurance evaluation, please provide **ONE** of the following:\n\n### **Option 1: Generate New Episode**\nProvide scenario input in any format:\n- Basic plot outline\n- Scene list with locations/events\n- Theme/character focus directive\n- \"Generate next episode\" command\n\n### **Option 2: Submit Existing Episode**\nProvide completed episode data including:\n- Full scene breakdown\n- Complete dialogue\n- Visual direction notes\n- Panel-by-panel structure\n\n### **Option 3: Quick Generation**\nUse instant generation mode:\n- `\"Next episode in series\"`\n- `\"Character-focused episode: [Name]\"`\n- `\"Standalone side story\"`\n\n---\n\n## 📝 QA AGENT READINESS CONFIRMATION\n\n```yaml\nAgent_Status: ✅ ACTIVE\nEvaluation_Framework: ✅ LOADED\nCharacter_Database: ✅ SYNCHRONIZED\n  - Reina \"Ren\" Shimizu: Voice patterns loaded\n  - Cipher: Behavioral matrix ready\n  - Vex: Chaos parameters calibrated\n  - Architects: Threat assessment models active\n\nSHACL_Validator: ✅ INITIALIZED\nScoring_Rubrics: ✅ CALIBRATED\nCritical_Analysis_Mode: ✅ ENGAGED\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🚨 FINAL RECOMMENDATION\n\n**PRODUCTION STATUS**: **BLOCKED**\n\n**Blocker**: No episode content available for review\n\n**Action Required**: \n1. Generate episode content using the Episode Generator System\n2. Resubmit for comprehensive QA evaluation\n3. Expect detailed critique with actionable feedback\n\n**Exp